WEBVTT

00:21.730 --> 00:24.441
There has been an increase
in reports of youths in distress

00:24.524 --> 00:27.235
due to excessive anger within peer groups

00:27.318 --> 00:29.904
and the emotional challenges that follow.

00:29.988 --> 00:34.367
A public servant took their life
after enduring malicious complaints.

00:34.451 --> 00:36.286
Experts say this phenomenon

00:36.369 --> 00:41.124
is due to a mental disorder
called intermittent explosive disorder.

00:41.207 --> 00:43.126
A study also found that our students face

00:43.209 --> 00:46.004
some of the highest academic stress
in the world.

00:46.087 --> 00:49.632
Currently, in South Korea,
random assaults and homicides are rampant,

00:49.716 --> 00:52.635
and incidents like animal cruelty
continue to occur.

00:52.719 --> 00:54.929
According to
annual global suicide statistics,

00:55.013 --> 00:59.392
South Korea has the highest suicide rate
among OECD member countries.

01:02.687 --> 01:03.772
VOLUNTARY ISOLATION

01:04.689 --> 01:05.774
SOCIAL ANXIETY

01:07.484 --> 01:08.443
DOPAMINE ADDICTION

01:08.526 --> 01:09.778
ROAD RAGE, DATING VIOLENCE

01:21.956 --> 01:23.750
- Sobriety check, please.
- Sure.

01:31.800 --> 01:35.178
Officer Lee,
is everything good at Domyeong Market?

01:35.678 --> 01:36.888
Yes, everything is fine.

01:48.358 --> 01:49.359
My neck.

01:51.694 --> 01:55.031
You're driving me nuts.
What rotten luck to start the morning.

01:55.115 --> 01:58.326
Seriously, why would you ram
into a stationary car?

01:58.409 --> 02:00.120
You should watch where you're going!

02:02.413 --> 02:03.748
Look here, young lady.

02:03.832 --> 02:05.667
Do you even know how to drive?

02:06.251 --> 02:07.961
- I'm so sorry.
- Good God.

02:08.044 --> 02:09.212
Good morning.

02:10.421 --> 02:12.507
Please calm down. Are you badly injured?

02:13.091 --> 02:15.176
I totally think I've got whiplash.

02:15.260 --> 02:17.053
- Are you okay?
- Yes.

02:17.137 --> 02:18.763
Let's all calm down.

02:18.847 --> 02:21.391
Why don't you report the accident
to your insurance first

02:21.474 --> 02:22.934
and then move your cars?

02:23.017 --> 02:24.978
As you can see, the traffic is backed up.

02:26.187 --> 02:27.522
Thank you. Bye.

02:32.485 --> 02:33.862
Let me help you with that.

02:38.032 --> 02:39.117
NURSE
PARK SO-HYEON

02:39.200 --> 02:40.618
You must be exhausted.

02:40.702 --> 02:41.536
Oh, yes.

02:41.619 --> 02:45.540
I was on my way home after a night shift
and dozed off while driving.

02:46.040 --> 02:49.043
Are you okay to drive?
You should consider calling a driver.

02:49.127 --> 02:52.422
No, I'm wide awake now,
so I should be okay. Thank you.

02:52.505 --> 02:54.966
- I see. Drive safely.
- Have a good day.

03:05.393 --> 03:08.688
RANKED SAFEST COUNTRY
FOR 10 CONSECUTIVE YEARS

03:10.773 --> 03:13.401
Look here. Come on.

03:13.484 --> 03:15.820
- Hey, it's 5,000 won.
- I'm not interested.

03:15.904 --> 03:18.781
Why not? It's 5,000 won.

03:18.865 --> 03:21.451
It's 5,000 won. What do you think?

03:21.534 --> 03:23.369
It's 5,000 won. You want one?

03:23.453 --> 03:26.164
It's only 5,000 won.

03:26.748 --> 03:27.665
Hey, 5,000 won!

03:32.921 --> 03:34.297
Wait, this is a lighter!

03:34.380 --> 03:36.090
A cigarette lighter.

03:38.051 --> 03:40.053
No guns are allowed in Korea.

03:40.136 --> 03:42.847
You're not allowed to own guns
in Korea, right?

03:42.931 --> 03:45.099
Good grief. Don't worry.

03:45.183 --> 03:46.434
You're not buying, right?

03:47.352 --> 03:48.561
Have a good trip.

03:49.479 --> 03:51.397
As you just saw,

03:51.481 --> 03:55.318
this new gas lighter is so real
that it will stun even foreigners.

03:55.401 --> 03:57.487
It's 10,000 won for a nostalgic M16,

03:57.570 --> 03:59.447
and 5,000 won for a Glock.

03:59.530 --> 04:02.700
You know what it never runs out of? Gas!

04:02.784 --> 04:04.410
THIS SEAT IS FOR PREGNANT WOMEN

04:11.125 --> 04:11.960
Excuse me.

04:13.503 --> 04:15.255
This seat is for pregnant women.

04:16.172 --> 04:17.006
What?

04:18.424 --> 04:21.177
This seat is for pregnant women,
and this lady is standing.

04:21.261 --> 04:23.012
I think you should give her the seat.

04:23.096 --> 04:26.224
Hey, why the hell do you care?

04:29.227 --> 04:30.353
No, it's just that…

04:31.396 --> 04:33.189
It's not mandatory per se,

04:33.273 --> 04:36.192
but rules are made
for everyone to follow, so--

04:36.276 --> 04:38.611
Man, I'm already tired enough as it is.

04:40.029 --> 04:41.322
I'm fine.

04:42.490 --> 04:44.075
People are looking.

04:49.372 --> 04:50.248
Well, sir…

04:50.331 --> 04:52.375
Please stop. I'm really okay.

04:53.001 --> 04:54.794
Besides, I'm getting off soon.

04:56.546 --> 04:57.547
Thank you.

05:01.676 --> 05:05.805
It's 10,000 won for an M16.
It's as good as free. Check it out.

05:44.677 --> 05:46.596
Please watch where you're going.

05:46.679 --> 05:47.680
I'm sorry.

05:54.020 --> 05:55.021
ENGLISH ACADEMY

06:04.947 --> 06:07.825
How would Party A feel?
They'd be shocked, right?

06:07.909 --> 06:09.994
So Party A doesn't permit--

06:10.495 --> 06:15.041
Hey, I told you not to come in
if you thought you'd be late!

06:15.124 --> 06:17.877
Everyone,
look at how terrible he is with time.

06:17.960 --> 06:20.838
That's why he fails his exam every year.

06:27.387 --> 06:28.805
DILIGENCE
SHORTCUT TO PASSING!

06:28.888 --> 06:30.139
Hurry! Get out!

06:49.742 --> 06:51.536
Well, I feel so much better now.

07:00.962 --> 07:04.257
The test results
are much worse than last time.

07:05.716 --> 07:07.009
As time goes on,

07:08.469 --> 07:11.222
this and this keep fighting.

07:11.806 --> 07:13.599
This wants me to do something,

07:13.683 --> 07:15.726
but this suppresses it.

07:16.561 --> 07:17.395
It's confusing.

07:18.229 --> 07:20.690
You haven't been taking
your meds lately, have you?

07:21.274 --> 07:25.111
The medicine makes me drowsy,
so I find it hard to study.

07:27.405 --> 07:29.657
If I fail again this year,
it'll be my tenth year.

07:30.783 --> 07:32.618
Everyone lives with emotions

07:33.578 --> 07:37.915
like anxiety, compulsion, and depression.

07:37.999 --> 07:41.794
We just have different ways
of controlling and alleviating them.

07:43.254 --> 07:44.964
Does that mean I'm normal?

07:46.466 --> 07:47.300
As long as

07:47.884 --> 07:48.801
your head

07:50.595 --> 07:52.597
is not overpowered by your heart.

07:56.350 --> 08:01.189
Everyone carries a trigger in their heart.

08:02.648 --> 08:04.859
But a person with a healthy mind

08:04.942 --> 08:08.070
would never pull that trigger.

08:09.489 --> 08:15.036
The medication will help keep you
from pulling the trigger, Jeong-tae.

08:19.874 --> 08:21.709
Everyone has a trigger.

08:24.962 --> 08:26.714
Wow, so many of them came out.

08:27.215 --> 08:30.343
Why is this damn country
so rife with conflict?

08:31.302 --> 08:32.970
At this scale,

08:33.471 --> 08:36.349
it's almost like
someone is inciting the conflict, right?

08:38.976 --> 08:41.354
You still don't see
how easy you have it, do you?

08:41.979 --> 08:45.483
Hey, what does it matter
whether it's incited or voluntary?

08:47.485 --> 08:51.447
It's all money for us,
so take their pictures with gratitude.

08:52.448 --> 08:55.159
Come on, Reporter Wang.
What are you saying?

08:56.118 --> 08:58.788
We now live in a world
where conflict makes money.

08:59.413 --> 09:01.123
Make it look ten times more crowded.

09:01.207 --> 09:04.043
Workers, rise up
and fight for your rights!

09:04.126 --> 09:06.379
Rise up!

09:06.462 --> 09:09.840
That's our bread and butter, after all.

09:14.762 --> 09:15.596
Hey there!

09:16.806 --> 09:21.185
You haven't paid your rent in ten months.
How do you expect me to survive?

09:21.269 --> 09:22.645
Not gonna come out?

09:22.728 --> 09:25.022
Fine, then. I've had enough of this.

09:27.066 --> 09:30.027
Goodness. What's that rotten stench?

09:33.823 --> 09:37.076
Look at all these bills.
What's with all this trash?

09:37.577 --> 09:39.954
I shouldn't have rented this place out.

09:40.037 --> 09:41.122
This is seriously…

09:47.962 --> 09:49.130
Anything on the body?

09:50.214 --> 09:51.966
There's no sign of forced entry.

09:52.049 --> 09:53.426
No sign of a homicide either.

09:53.509 --> 09:56.637
Looking at the marks on his neck,
suicide is the most likely cause.

09:58.014 --> 09:58.848
All right.

10:00.224 --> 10:01.642
Detective Seo!

10:01.726 --> 10:02.768
Yeah?

10:02.852 --> 10:05.271
- I found something here.
- What is it?

10:13.279 --> 10:14.363
What is this?

10:16.907 --> 10:18.951
- What are these kids doing here?
- Hello.

10:19.035 --> 10:20.119
Hello.

10:20.202 --> 10:21.037
- Hi.
- Hello.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.121
So,

10:23.205 --> 10:24.582
what brings you here?

10:24.665 --> 10:26.459
We found this on the street.

10:28.127 --> 10:28.961
Really?

10:31.922 --> 10:33.758
- Hold on, kids.
- Yes?

10:33.841 --> 10:35.384
- Take one.
- Wow!

10:35.468 --> 10:37.637
- Wow!
- Thank you.

10:37.720 --> 10:39.805
Hey, kids. One each.

10:39.889 --> 10:41.098
- One each.
- Take more.

10:41.182 --> 10:42.600
- Take two or three.
- Thank you.

10:42.683 --> 10:44.935
- Sure. Off you go.
- Thank you.

10:45.019 --> 10:46.062
Hey, Do.

10:46.145 --> 10:48.939
Don't give out so many.
It's all taxpayer money.

10:49.023 --> 10:51.108
You had way more than they did, sir.

10:51.192 --> 10:54.070
If my blood sugar drops at my age,
I'll go straight into shock.

10:54.654 --> 10:56.906
- Would you like one, then?
- Should I?

10:56.989 --> 10:59.909
I really shouldn't.
It's almost time for lunch, right?

11:07.249 --> 11:08.876
- Hey. What's up?
- Hey, Do.

11:08.959 --> 11:12.421
I have a situation here.
Can you come over for a second?

11:18.969 --> 11:20.888
- He had these on his body?
- Yeah.

11:21.389 --> 11:24.850
In all my years as a police officer,
I've never seen anything like this.

11:25.935 --> 11:29.313
I thought you might know something,
so I called you first.

11:30.606 --> 11:33.150
You're pretty much an expert in this area.

11:34.110 --> 11:35.069
What do you think?

11:38.364 --> 11:40.574
Obviously, these must not be registered.

11:41.450 --> 11:43.994
Did you find anything besides the bullets?

11:44.078 --> 11:44.912
Nope.

11:45.413 --> 11:48.416
Do you think
they were smuggled out of a military base?

11:51.419 --> 11:52.253
I'm not sure.

11:52.336 --> 11:56.340
Out of all bullets, these are only used
by a small portion of the military.

11:56.841 --> 11:58.968
They're not easy to get hold of.

12:00.803 --> 12:02.471
What was the deceased's job?

12:03.806 --> 12:05.182
Unemployed, apparently.

12:06.851 --> 12:07.685
Unemployed?

12:07.768 --> 12:08.769
Yeah.

12:13.691 --> 12:17.945
He has a criminal record
and got out of prison not too long ago.

12:18.946 --> 12:21.824
We checked the house thoroughly,
but there was nothing unusual.

12:24.368 --> 12:27.705
Man, even one missing shell casing
is a huge deal in the military,

12:27.788 --> 12:31.083
but here we are
with a whole bunch of bullets.

12:35.379 --> 12:36.297
What's up?

12:37.882 --> 12:38.883
You see something?

12:49.143 --> 12:51.103
Holy crap. What's all this?

13:01.030 --> 13:04.033
YEONGSEONG GOSIWON

13:06.035 --> 13:09.830
Why do these broke-ass morons
keep ordering stuff all the time?

13:17.671 --> 13:19.089
Are you done with this?

13:19.173 --> 13:20.007
Yeah.

13:43.739 --> 13:45.533
Just stop it already.

13:48.118 --> 13:49.995
Just let me study, for God's sake.

13:50.746 --> 13:52.248
Babe, you're driving me crazy.

13:55.292 --> 13:56.877
You fucking like that shit?

14:02.007 --> 14:03.551
YU JEONG-TAE

14:07.388 --> 14:09.515
Just when I thought I'd seen it all.

14:10.224 --> 14:13.936
Seriously? Dozens of bullets
pouring down from the ceiling?

14:14.019 --> 14:16.522
It would be ridiculous, even in a movie.

14:18.232 --> 14:21.694
But where the hell did that bastard
even get all those bullets?

14:22.194 --> 14:26.073
I'm not sure. Detective Seo
is looking into it, so he'll find out.

14:26.156 --> 14:28.784
Yeah, just sit back and wait.

14:29.660 --> 14:32.872
Don't butt in
just because you know that stuff, okay?

14:32.955 --> 14:36.667
They say, "Ignorance is bliss,
and knowledge is a curse," right?

14:38.586 --> 14:41.839
Anyway, you're not taking
the promotion exam again?

14:43.132 --> 14:45.634
I'm happy and comfortable where I am.

14:45.718 --> 14:49.388
I'm uncomfortable
seeing you like this, you punk.

14:50.097 --> 14:51.098
Look.

14:51.932 --> 14:54.977
Given your age,
skills, experience, and abilities,

14:55.060 --> 14:57.855
you should've been a sergeant long ago,
if not higher.

14:57.938 --> 15:00.816
Others are just dying to get a promotion.

15:01.317 --> 15:02.359
Good grief.

15:02.443 --> 15:06.530
The disobedient subordinate
or the daughter driving me up the wall.

15:07.031 --> 15:09.366
I don't know who to be more upset with.

15:10.284 --> 15:11.535
What's up with Se-yeong?

15:11.619 --> 15:13.871
She's insisting on moving out now.

15:13.954 --> 15:16.832
She says work-life balance
is important or something.

15:17.416 --> 15:19.752
- Isn't it time she moved out?
- What?

15:20.878 --> 15:22.838
Are you taking Se-yeong's side?

15:24.381 --> 15:27.676
She's using up every penny
of her hard-earned money.

15:27.760 --> 15:30.596
I wouldn't be this upset
if she were paying monthly rent.

15:30.679 --> 15:34.683
Why does she have to get a loan
just to get a jeonse and move out?

15:34.767 --> 15:36.268
She's chasing work-life balance

15:36.352 --> 15:39.188
while I'm completely losing
my emotional balance.

15:40.564 --> 15:43.692
This way! Do, this is my daughter's car.

15:43.776 --> 15:45.903
- Just one more round.
- No, we've had enough.

15:45.986 --> 15:49.823
You shouldn't keep
piling up debt like that, you punk.

15:49.907 --> 15:51.241
Seriously.

15:52.368 --> 15:53.869
You're moving out?

15:53.953 --> 15:54.870
Yeah.

15:55.579 --> 15:56.580
I'm so excited.

15:57.081 --> 15:59.541
The commute alone took two hours.

15:59.625 --> 16:04.088
It only takes me 30 minutes now,
and it's a new building. Amazing, right?

16:04.880 --> 16:06.340
Do you need anything?

16:06.423 --> 16:10.094
Maybe just a TV, sofa, and fridge?

16:10.177 --> 16:11.178
That's about it.

16:11.762 --> 16:12.638
Just go home now.

16:12.721 --> 16:13.847
Cheapskate.

16:13.931 --> 16:15.182
- See you!
- Okay.

16:15.265 --> 16:16.100
Bye.

16:32.074 --> 16:33.367
Come in, Lee Do!

16:33.450 --> 16:35.869
All units are isolated. Retreat, everyone!

16:36.787 --> 16:39.498
We can't. There are still survivors
on the battlefield.

16:39.581 --> 16:41.875
We must retreat first.
That's an order. Retreat!

16:43.460 --> 16:44.294
Sergeant Lee!

16:45.212 --> 16:48.590
Bullets are flying from everywhere.
Help me, Sergeant Lee.

16:49.466 --> 16:50.759
Sergeant Lee!

16:50.843 --> 16:54.013
Why, your grades are excellent.

16:54.096 --> 16:56.640
Goodness, you're quite well-built too.

16:57.224 --> 16:58.851
And a black belt in tae kwon do.

16:58.934 --> 17:02.438
I majored in physical education
and served in the Marine Corps!

17:02.521 --> 17:03.480
Wow.

17:04.356 --> 17:05.983
What a remarkable guy.

17:06.066 --> 17:09.361
Thank you. Certain… I mean, yes, sir!

17:09.445 --> 17:12.114
Yeah, sure. Let's give it our all.

17:14.199 --> 17:16.869
So, who is my training officer?

17:16.952 --> 17:19.163
Well, the one who will be training you…

17:20.289 --> 17:21.540
There he is. Behind you.

17:26.920 --> 17:29.715
Were you an admin soldier by any chance?

17:31.467 --> 17:33.135
- Sorry?
- You know…

17:33.635 --> 17:38.390
I thought you might be one
after seeing you type so carefully.

17:38.474 --> 17:41.894
Being a police officer
involves lots of paperwork.

17:42.519 --> 17:44.938
You'll get accustomed to it in no time.

17:45.522 --> 17:49.860
But paperwork is not really my thing.

17:50.527 --> 17:51.487
You know,

17:51.570 --> 17:55.449
I'm gonna round up
every single bad guy I lay my eyes on.

17:55.532 --> 17:59.745
And if it seems like a violent crime,
I'll just fire my gun to solve it

17:59.828 --> 18:02.081
and head right
to the Regional Investigation Unit.

18:02.164 --> 18:05.167
Doesn't it look like
I'd be a good fit for that?

18:05.667 --> 18:06.502
Sure.

18:06.585 --> 18:08.128
LISTEN TO MY DEAD SON'S MESSAGE!

18:08.212 --> 18:09.922
APOLOGIZE!
BAN DANGEROUS OUTSOURCING

18:26.063 --> 18:29.650
WORKERS MUST BE SAVED,
NOT CORPORATIONS

18:30.484 --> 18:31.318
Ma'am.

18:32.736 --> 18:34.446
You can't do this here.

18:35.030 --> 18:37.616
I'm not breaking any laws.

18:37.699 --> 18:40.327
Well, we received a complaint about this.

18:40.410 --> 18:43.455
As per the rules and principles,
we must handle all complaints.

18:43.539 --> 18:44.373
Mrs. Oh.

18:44.456 --> 18:47.835
Excuse me,
I'm just doing what I do every day.

18:48.335 --> 18:50.295
Am I not allowed today?

18:50.379 --> 18:51.255
Not at all.

18:51.338 --> 18:54.466
One-person protests are legally protected,
so there's no problem.

18:55.592 --> 18:57.010
There's no problem at all,

18:57.594 --> 19:00.180
but gatherings of two or more
must be reported as a rally.

19:01.348 --> 19:02.558
Look at him over there.

19:02.641 --> 19:06.019
As long as you stay 20 meters away
from him, no one can bother you.

19:06.728 --> 19:09.481
If anyone bothers you,
you know what to do.

19:12.776 --> 19:14.111
SEOBU POLICE STATION
LEE DO

19:15.112 --> 19:16.196
You still have it.

19:20.242 --> 19:21.410
Sir.

19:21.493 --> 19:22.703
Sir!

19:23.412 --> 19:25.539
Sir!

19:25.622 --> 19:26.790
- I just--
- What's wrong?

19:26.874 --> 19:28.250
I just want to talk to you.

19:28.333 --> 19:29.751
Why is that so hard?

19:29.835 --> 19:32.004
Officer Lee.
Isn't this preferential treatment?

19:32.504 --> 19:35.257
- I know you are in the car!
- Please, ma'am.

19:35.340 --> 19:36.341
In what way?

19:36.425 --> 19:39.511
Aren't they reporting her
for obstruction of business every hour?

19:39.595 --> 19:43.140
I feel like we, as the police,
should resolve this complaint.

19:44.183 --> 19:46.018
As I said, it's legally protected.

19:46.518 --> 19:48.353
Let's just talk, please!

19:48.437 --> 19:51.440
Her son took on a dangerous job
that no one else would do

19:51.523 --> 19:54.484
for only a third
of a regular employee's salary

19:54.568 --> 19:56.278
and ended up dying in an accident.

19:56.361 --> 19:59.990
But no one apologized
or took responsibility,

20:00.490 --> 20:02.034
and she was forced to cremate his body.

20:03.243 --> 20:06.121
It's also our job
to properly inform them of their rights

20:06.205 --> 20:07.164
and look after them.

20:08.749 --> 20:09.917
Sir!

20:10.000 --> 20:11.001
Go help her.

20:12.044 --> 20:13.295
She might fall ill.

20:13.795 --> 20:15.088
I just want to talk.

20:17.132 --> 20:17.966
Ma'am?

20:22.721 --> 20:24.556
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

20:26.266 --> 20:28.101
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

20:31.647 --> 20:33.482
There's no need to give me anything.

20:33.565 --> 20:34.942
It's nothing.

20:35.025 --> 20:38.862
You need strength to keep fighting.
Standing here all day must be tiring.

20:39.363 --> 20:40.656
At least eat something.

20:40.739 --> 20:41.990
YAKGWA

20:46.245 --> 20:48.914
I'm just sorry and grateful.

20:48.997 --> 20:51.124
It's really nothing much.

20:53.210 --> 20:55.337
This is the entry for vehicles,
so let's move.

20:55.420 --> 20:57.297
- Here, let me carry that.
- Goodness.

21:00.133 --> 21:01.760
YEONGSEONG GOSIWON
FULLY FURNISHED

21:31.123 --> 21:31.957
What is it?

21:32.833 --> 21:34.209
Someone ate my food again.

21:34.293 --> 21:35.585
What food?

21:35.669 --> 21:38.797
My mom made some braised anchovies
and sent them to me.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.966
I put it in my spot with my name on it

21:41.049 --> 21:43.927
and hid it behind the kimchi container,
but everything's moved.

21:44.011 --> 21:46.013
Seriously? Who pulled that crap this time?

21:48.557 --> 21:50.726
I've put notes on my food countless times,

21:50.809 --> 21:52.853
asking people not to touch it.
Why don't you--

21:52.936 --> 21:56.273
I got it already!
How many times do you have to say it?

21:57.691 --> 21:59.401
And you know unit 306?

22:00.110 --> 22:03.613
I keep hearing a woman moan from there.
He must be bringing his girlfriend.

22:04.364 --> 22:05.365
No way, Jeong-tae!

22:05.449 --> 22:08.994
Why enjoy that good stuff by yourself?
You should've called me right away.

22:09.077 --> 22:10.996
Outsiders are not allowed here.

22:12.706 --> 22:16.668
Rules are meant to be followed.
Why doesn't anyone here follow them?

22:16.752 --> 22:20.380
Jeong-tae, I'm begging you.

22:20.464 --> 22:23.342
Don't just stay cooped up
in your room studying.

22:23.425 --> 22:26.928
Go outside, get some sun,
and breathe in some fresh air.

22:27.012 --> 22:28.972
Why are you so uptight?

22:29.056 --> 22:31.600
That's how you get fucked up,
become a social misfit,

22:31.683 --> 22:33.226
a lunatic with a victim mentality.

22:34.728 --> 22:36.396
Are you ignoring me now?

22:37.606 --> 22:39.608
It's called advice, not ignoring.

22:39.691 --> 22:42.694
All right, I get it. Now go and study.

22:42.778 --> 22:44.946
Just go. I get it, so leave now.

22:46.198 --> 22:49.910
MANAGER'S OFFICE
PLEASE KNOCK

22:52.996 --> 22:54.164
What are you doing?

22:54.247 --> 22:55.624
Fucking useless morons.

23:04.132 --> 23:04.966
What?

23:05.884 --> 23:07.511
I'm from unit 307.

23:09.096 --> 23:11.723
You can't smoke in your room,
with the smoke and all.

23:12.307 --> 23:14.601
That's why I have the door open
to air it out.

23:15.727 --> 23:18.855
If you let the air out like this,
the smoke spreads to other rooms.

23:19.439 --> 23:23.151
This is a smoke-free zone.
That's the rule, so we should all--

23:23.235 --> 23:24.611
You fucking son of a bitch.

23:26.488 --> 23:28.490
What did you say? The rule?

23:29.699 --> 23:30.700
Hey, you fucker.

23:31.743 --> 23:33.203
This was you, wasn't it?

23:33.870 --> 23:37.541
Do I look like some loser
who steals your food? Do I?

23:39.000 --> 23:40.502
I just put it as a notice for…

23:40.585 --> 23:41.962
Shut your damn mouth.

23:46.425 --> 23:49.428
See what happens
if you post something like this again.

23:49.511 --> 23:50.679
I'll kill you for real.

23:56.768 --> 23:59.438
If you got that, piss off,
you motherfucker.

24:07.446 --> 24:09.114
Fucking son of a bitch.

24:38.143 --> 24:41.062
You fucking maniac. Keep it down!

24:44.524 --> 24:46.318
You can't, you crazy bastard.

24:48.695 --> 24:50.989
Control yourself, you crazy bastard.

25:09.716 --> 25:10.759
Control yourself.

25:12.844 --> 25:13.887
Control yourself.

25:59.140 --> 26:00.350
Maybe no one's home?

26:02.435 --> 26:03.562
Who is it?

26:05.897 --> 26:09.818
Hello, is this
Ms. Park Kyeong-ja's residence?

26:10.318 --> 26:11.570
"Park Kyeong-ja"?

26:11.653 --> 26:14.906
Oh, Mom went to the grocery store.

26:14.990 --> 26:17.117
You recently installed
a water purifier, right?

26:17.200 --> 26:19.369
This is our first maintenance visit.

26:19.452 --> 26:20.287
Come in.

26:22.622 --> 26:24.165
Excuse me.

26:27.127 --> 26:28.044
It's inside.

26:42.517 --> 26:45.186
Have you experienced any issues
with the purifier?

26:46.605 --> 26:47.564
No.

26:48.064 --> 26:49.357
I love it so much.

26:49.858 --> 26:51.192
Totally my type.

26:52.027 --> 26:54.988
Let me know if you'd like a model
with an ice dispenser.

26:56.823 --> 26:59.826
I'll arrange everything for you
with a special deal.

27:06.583 --> 27:07.751
"Special deal"?

27:23.266 --> 27:24.476
A special deal, huh?

27:25.185 --> 27:26.936
You startled me.

27:30.607 --> 27:32.942
Yes, there are many different freebies.

27:33.526 --> 27:35.737
I see. "Freebies."

27:40.742 --> 27:42.410
Would you like a cold drink?

27:43.620 --> 27:45.205
No, I'm fine.

27:45.288 --> 27:46.289
Right.

28:16.319 --> 28:18.238
You're not married, are you?

28:18.321 --> 28:21.574
Actually, I've been married for a while.

28:22.617 --> 28:23.827
Right.

28:25.161 --> 28:26.705
So you're a married woman.

28:27.205 --> 28:29.833
I guess you aren't married yet.

28:30.542 --> 28:33.670
You should find a good woman
and get married soon.

29:00.864 --> 29:02.407
Probably unlikely, huh?

29:02.490 --> 29:03.324
Sorry?

29:04.659 --> 29:06.494
I'm not sure what you mean.

29:07.370 --> 29:09.038
I'm talking about marriage.

29:14.586 --> 29:16.504
Sorry, that's none of my business.

29:17.130 --> 29:18.590
I'll finish up quickly.

29:24.262 --> 29:25.305
Finish up.

29:26.264 --> 29:27.891
I'm going out for a smoke.

29:36.900 --> 29:37.817
You're leaving?

29:59.881 --> 30:00.924
Is Mr. Jeon home?

30:03.718 --> 30:04.719
What do you want?

30:05.303 --> 30:06.429
This is the police.

30:07.263 --> 30:11.059
We need to check your ankle monitor.
The signal's been acting up.

30:11.142 --> 30:12.143
Is this a good time?

30:13.394 --> 30:14.521
No, it's not.

30:14.604 --> 30:16.272
Well, if it's not…

30:16.356 --> 30:19.442
Sir, I'm done changing
your water purifier filter.

30:19.526 --> 30:20.777
Have a good day.

30:20.860 --> 30:21.861
Ms. Ko Ji-yeong.

30:23.196 --> 30:24.113
Come back soon.

30:25.281 --> 30:27.450
I'll switch to the purifier
that dispenses ice.

30:40.880 --> 30:42.757
Could you take a quick look inside?

30:42.841 --> 30:43.883
Sure thing.

30:54.269 --> 30:55.478
God, that scared me.

31:00.483 --> 31:01.651
Are you all right?

31:01.734 --> 31:03.570
Thank you so much for earlier.

31:04.571 --> 31:06.114
Did something happen in there?

31:06.197 --> 31:08.283
I saw his ankle monitor.

31:09.826 --> 31:11.369
And I got so scared, so…

31:11.953 --> 31:13.663
Next time you make a home visit,

31:13.746 --> 31:17.000
it might be helpful
to check the sex offender registry.

31:22.881 --> 31:25.383
Officer Lee, I'll check his ankle monitor.

31:25.967 --> 31:27.969
I'm going to take a look around.

31:43.902 --> 31:46.529
Mr. Jeon Won-seong.
Do you have any family?

31:46.613 --> 31:47.989
I live alone. Why?

31:48.740 --> 31:50.450
Gonna set me up with a woman?

31:53.912 --> 31:54.913
I see.

31:55.788 --> 31:57.415
Then who is Park Kyeong-ja?

31:59.709 --> 32:01.044
My mom. Why?

32:01.794 --> 32:03.630
But you just said you live alone.

32:03.713 --> 32:08.009
Hey, what are you trying to do here?
Pick a fight? Joke around?

32:09.510 --> 32:12.805
Who could live under their own name
with this on their ankle?

32:12.889 --> 32:15.141
For fuck's sake, seriously.

32:15.642 --> 32:16.643
You scared me.

32:18.978 --> 32:21.397
Well, there's no need to get so upset.

32:26.319 --> 32:28.863
Look at this motherfucker
running his mouth.

32:32.408 --> 32:33.534
Please don't swear.

32:34.452 --> 32:38.164
I just did, you motherfucking pig.
What are you gonna do about it?

32:38.247 --> 32:39.832
Fucking hell.

32:40.333 --> 32:41.542
All right, I get it.

32:42.085 --> 32:45.088
Put your foot out without a fuss.
I'll just check it and leave.

32:46.214 --> 32:47.048
Come on.

32:47.548 --> 32:48.383
Your foot!

32:49.300 --> 32:53.054
Here, my fucking foot.
Do whatever the hell you want.

33:00.603 --> 33:02.146
So your name's Jang Jeong-u?

33:07.652 --> 33:09.696
Are both your parents still alive?

33:11.364 --> 33:12.365
That's enough.

33:21.332 --> 33:23.001
How's the signal right now?

33:23.084 --> 33:24.711
There doesn't seem to be issues.

33:25.503 --> 33:28.715
I checked the seam and the back,
and there were no marks.

33:29.549 --> 33:30.383
Yes.

33:31.551 --> 33:32.719
Too bad, Jeong-u.

33:38.391 --> 33:39.767
Your parents will be crushed.

33:46.774 --> 33:48.901
You motherfucker! Let go of me.

33:55.783 --> 33:56.701
No issues?

33:57.493 --> 33:58.327
Well,

33:59.203 --> 34:00.038
no.

34:00.621 --> 34:02.457
No issues with the monitor.

34:03.958 --> 34:05.835
For fuck's sake!

34:05.918 --> 34:09.172
Why is everyone out to get me?

34:10.715 --> 34:11.716
Let's go.

34:14.677 --> 34:15.553
Hey!

34:16.054 --> 34:17.597
You two, stop right there.

34:18.806 --> 34:20.850
I may have committed a crime,

34:20.933 --> 34:24.020
but I still have human rights!

34:25.021 --> 34:28.107
Why do you police insist
on suffocating me like this?

34:28.608 --> 34:29.442
Why?

34:30.485 --> 34:33.988
If you keep ignoring my rights
and suffocating me like this,

34:34.072 --> 34:35.823
I won't take it anymore.

34:41.287 --> 34:44.624
You're wearing that ankle monitor
because we respect human rights.

34:47.627 --> 34:48.461
Got it?

34:57.470 --> 34:58.930
What a fucking joke.

34:59.722 --> 35:00.640
"Respect"?

35:02.016 --> 35:03.810
He said respect. Respect!

35:13.069 --> 35:14.487
I'm sorry, Officer Lee.

35:17.532 --> 35:20.701
No need to be sorry.
Just remember this one thing in the field.

35:21.702 --> 35:23.663
Treat victims with empathy

35:24.539 --> 35:26.374
and criminals with the law.

35:26.457 --> 35:30.461
Yes, sir. I'll take your words to heart.

35:32.130 --> 35:32.964
Officer Jang.

35:33.840 --> 35:36.217
- Yes?
- Don't just take them to heart.

35:36.300 --> 35:37.969
When we get back, type it up

35:38.052 --> 35:39.679
in Malgun Gothic font, size 11.

35:40.179 --> 35:41.472
Right. Yes.

35:42.306 --> 35:43.307
Font size 11.

35:47.395 --> 35:49.480
Yet another shooting took place.

35:49.564 --> 35:53.693
At least 15 victims were killed
in an elementary school shooting…

35:53.776 --> 35:57.613
What kind of developed country
has shootings all the time? Fucking scary.

35:57.697 --> 35:58.531
Hey.

35:59.615 --> 36:03.202
That's why our country
is a fucking great place to live, right?

36:03.703 --> 36:06.414
Let's turn to our US correspondent,
Bae Su-hyeon.

36:06.497 --> 36:09.333
A great place, my ass.
Thank God Hell Joseon has no guns.

36:09.417 --> 36:12.503
All three of us
already know how to shoot guns.

36:12.587 --> 36:13.754
We all did our service.

36:13.838 --> 36:16.841
Hey, quit the unrealistic talk
and check this out.

36:17.341 --> 36:19.635
Bitcoin is tanking again. Seriously.

36:19.719 --> 36:21.554
Are you still fucking into Bitcoin?

36:21.637 --> 36:23.806
- You're addicted.
- I hit my overdraft limit.

36:37.320 --> 36:38.988
- You jackass, I…
- Seriously!

36:39.071 --> 36:40.323
Hey, for fuck's sake…

36:40.948 --> 36:43.868
Local authorities are investigating
the exact details of the incident.

36:43.951 --> 36:45.453
NO DRINKING! NO SMOKING! NO SHOUTING!

36:45.536 --> 36:49.123
They are considering additional measures
to improve school and community safety.

36:49.207 --> 36:50.041
The shooting…

36:50.124 --> 36:52.418
What the hell?
What's up with that bastard?

36:53.836 --> 36:56.297
One blank round, four live rounds.
All clear!

36:57.882 --> 36:59.717
Can I really trust you?

36:59.800 --> 37:00.801
Sir.

37:00.885 --> 37:01.761
LOUNGE, ARMORY

37:01.844 --> 37:06.474
I was the top marksman in the 313th class
of the Central Police Academy.

37:07.266 --> 37:09.060
All right, then. Fill that out.

37:16.817 --> 37:19.695
What about Officer Lee?
Isn't he taking a gun?

37:20.196 --> 37:23.282
Officer Lee prefers to use his Taser.

37:23.950 --> 37:24.951
Is that so?

37:25.034 --> 37:27.370
Anyway, I doubt
you'll even end up using it.

37:27.453 --> 37:29.372
But still, take good care of it, okay?

37:29.455 --> 37:31.540
- Yes, understood.
- Off you go, then.

37:40.132 --> 37:41.968
It's so nice and peaceful.

37:42.885 --> 37:44.553
Night duty is a walk in the park--

37:44.637 --> 37:46.055
Get over here, you punk.

37:46.138 --> 37:47.974
What was that? "Peaceful"?

37:48.057 --> 37:49.517
That's a banned word for us.

37:49.600 --> 37:50.726
- Take it back.
- Yes, sir.

37:50.810 --> 37:51.852
- Blow it away.
- Whoosh!

37:51.936 --> 37:54.188
What am I going to do with you, punk?

37:54.272 --> 37:55.648
- Hey, Lee Do!
- Sir?

37:55.731 --> 37:57.316
Train him properly!

37:58.109 --> 38:00.194
- Seriously, this punk!
- Officer Jang?

38:37.315 --> 38:38.858
You like that? Fuck!

38:38.941 --> 38:39.942
Please cut it out.

38:40.526 --> 38:41.610
Yeah, babe.

38:42.820 --> 38:45.072
I'm going to make you fucking scream.

38:46.073 --> 38:47.241
Please.

39:01.505 --> 39:04.675
For fuck's sake! I'm right next door!

39:04.759 --> 39:07.136
What the hell?
You said no one lived next door.

39:07.219 --> 39:10.639
So what? Fuck, that just makes it
even more exciting.

39:10.723 --> 39:11.557
Excuse me.

39:12.808 --> 39:14.435
Let's be considerate, okay?

39:14.518 --> 39:17.104
Fuck off, you asshole.

39:17.188 --> 39:18.689
You wanna do it too?

39:18.773 --> 39:21.233
If you're horny,
you can just jerk off while we do it.

39:21.317 --> 39:24.612
Listen when I'm talking to you,
you motherfuckers.

39:31.452 --> 39:33.120
This is why life is so hard.

39:39.627 --> 39:40.753
Hello, this is 112.

39:40.836 --> 39:42.671
A gun… Here…

39:43.255 --> 39:44.757
I mean, there's a gun here.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.092
Sorry? A gun?

39:48.677 --> 39:49.512
Hello?

39:50.346 --> 39:51.514
I just heard a gunshot.

39:51.597 --> 39:53.641
- Where are you located?
- Hurry, Mr. Officer.

39:53.724 --> 39:55.101
Hey, did you call the police?

39:59.188 --> 40:01.190
Did you call the police or not?

40:01.273 --> 40:03.067
Just answer me, okay?

40:03.567 --> 40:04.610
Hey!

40:05.319 --> 40:07.905
You ignored me
and called the police, didn't you?

40:11.951 --> 40:14.078
You said you heard gunshots?

40:14.954 --> 40:16.038
Hello?

40:17.748 --> 40:18.707
Can you hear me?

40:21.252 --> 40:23.337
You guys are gonna keep ignoring me, huh?

40:28.300 --> 40:29.385
Did she call to report?

40:29.885 --> 40:31.429
And who might you be, sir?

40:31.929 --> 40:33.848
- No, don't call me sir.
- Okay.

40:34.723 --> 40:37.143
I'm preparing
for the Grade 9 civil service exam.

40:37.226 --> 40:38.811
- Sir?
- Grade 7 was too hard.

40:38.894 --> 40:39.728
Sir?

40:39.812 --> 40:41.856
I was about to call you guys anyway.

40:41.939 --> 40:46.026
But these guys keep ignoring
what I'm saying right now.

40:46.110 --> 40:47.361
Where are you located?

40:47.445 --> 40:48.529
Yeongseong Gosiwon.

40:48.612 --> 40:49.447
Myeongseong?

40:49.530 --> 40:50.406
- Yeong.
- "Yeong."

40:50.489 --> 40:51.991
- Yes, that's it. Seong.
- "Seong."

40:52.074 --> 40:54.660
Third floor of Tomorrow Karaoke
near the overpass.

40:55.536 --> 40:57.371
But it's no use coming now.

41:00.958 --> 41:02.877
I already pulled the trigger.

41:06.839 --> 41:10.009
How many fucking times did I tell you
to go to a motel to fuck?

41:11.010 --> 41:12.636
The soundproofing is fucking shit.

41:18.476 --> 41:20.102
Don't kill me.

41:21.187 --> 41:22.021
Please.

41:29.612 --> 41:31.405
You're the asshole. Yeah, you.

41:32.072 --> 41:34.033
A motel room isn't even that expensive.

41:34.909 --> 41:38.245
But you bring your beautiful girlfriend
to this filthy place every time.

41:44.585 --> 41:46.003
Fuck this. I don't care.

41:48.964 --> 41:50.299
You take responsibility.

41:52.551 --> 41:53.552
EMERGENCY CALL

41:56.138 --> 41:56.972
How are things?

41:58.057 --> 41:59.850
Everything looks good.

42:00.684 --> 42:02.019
Press if you feel threatened.

42:02.102 --> 42:03.854
- I will. Thank you.
- Have a good night.

42:03.938 --> 42:08.192
Suspected shooting at Yeongseong Gosiwon.
All nearby units, deploy immediately!

42:08.275 --> 42:10.945
I repeat.
Suspected shooting at Yeongseong Gosiwon.

42:12.571 --> 42:15.074
Fucking hell. Your video game
is too damn loud…

42:15.658 --> 42:16.659
What are you doing?

42:18.953 --> 42:19.954
Where are you going?

42:22.957 --> 42:23.958
I…

42:29.255 --> 42:30.464
Hey, what was that?

42:32.299 --> 42:34.218
What the fuck? Hey, run!

42:37.221 --> 42:38.222
He's got a gun!

42:56.031 --> 42:56.949
Sorry.

42:57.032 --> 42:58.617
Hey, I'm sorry.

42:59.326 --> 43:01.495
You motherfucker. Please don't kill me.

43:01.579 --> 43:02.413
Why not?

43:03.247 --> 43:06.417
- You ignored me when I asked nicely.
- What's taking you so long?

43:06.500 --> 43:08.168
Please come quickly!

43:08.752 --> 43:11.672
Some crazy bastard
is shooting up the place!

43:12.172 --> 43:13.841
Please hurry. Come on!

43:19.972 --> 43:21.140
Jeong-tae.

43:21.223 --> 43:23.183
Why don't you do your job as a manager?

43:46.081 --> 43:47.207
Attention, everyone!

43:58.969 --> 44:01.180
Which one of you bastards
ate my anchovies?

48:10.554 --> 48:15.559
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
